  "m_dialogList": {
    "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.ActorDialogList, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
    "m_dialogs": [
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Prep",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "LM-URSAI-NPC06_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Oh right, we've already done that bit. Anyway, as I was saying, us real heroes have awesome hero tools... such as the Wahoo Net.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Chicken_Hero_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/LM/Bantam_LM-URSAI_012.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1520127,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "LM-URSAI-NPC06_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "The Net's toast now, but like the Bantam mantle itself, it was passed down from Bantam father to son. It caught many a flung Lemur over the years.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Chicken_Hero_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/LM/Bantam_LM-URSAI_013.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1520127,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "LM-URSAI-NPC06_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "See, ever since a would-be Wahoo saved my ancestor from Wing Brotherhood pirates, my family has been the sworn protector of mistreated Lemurs.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Chicken_Hero_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/LM/Bantam_LM-URSAI_014.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1520127,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "LM-SKY-NPC03_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Wizard, are these stairs? This is definitely not a natural geological formation. No doubt one of the Old One's Monitoring Stations is close.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Khrulhu_LinNoHat_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/LM/Dasein_LM-URSAI_032.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1524717,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "LM-URSAI-NPC06_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "But eventually, Lemuria settled down and the Bantam was needed less. So he became a Ghost, waiting, watching from the shadows.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Chicken_Hero_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/LM/Bantam_LM-URSAI_016.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1520127,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "LM-URSAI-NPC06_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "There were no eruptions, no Wahoos to save. Then, one day the ground shook and the sky changed colors. Suddenly everyone needs saving again!",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Chicken_Hero_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/LM/Bantam_LM-URSAI_017.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1520127,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "",
            "m_nameOverride": "Tosh Hole",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Um yeah, speaking of which, my grip is slipping. I'm going to fall! Ah waahooooo! I'm OK. But there are... creatures? HELP!",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Lemur_Musician_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/LM/Tosh_Hole_LM-URSAI_002.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 0,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "LM-URSAI-NPC06_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Sit tight, little Wahoo! The Bantam - and the Wizard - will save you! But how? Oh hey, look, there are stairs over there. Angel! It's hero time.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Chicken_Hero_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/LM/Bantam_LM-URSAI_018.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1520127,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Complete",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "LM-URSAI-NPC06_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Why, we're standing in the very domain of the Old One, aren't we? It's so... not what I expected. Are those... buttons?",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Chicken_Hero_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/LM/Bantam_LM-URSAI_023.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1520127,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
